# secrets
.env
# raw + derived data (never commit the 500MB Kaggle dump)
data/raw/
data/interim/
*.sqlite
# LLM response cache: llm/ IS committed (small — a few MB — and it's what makes
# `make eval` reproduce in minutes for anyone, regardless of their own provider's rate
# limits; see DECISIONS.md #17). Ignore everything else that might land in .cache/.
.cache/*
!.cache/llm/
# python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
# os
.DS_Store
.pytest_cache/
